      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "LoRA Roulette - how to use\n\n1. LoRA list: path ; trigger ; strength (optional). Old \"path;trigger\" lines work as-is. '#' disables a line.\n\n2. mode = random: every queue picks min_loras..max_loras LoRAs at random (roulette seed on 'randomize').\n   mode = sweep: set the roulette seed to 'increment' and queue - walks every unique combination once (no A+A, no B+A after A+B). 'Picked LoRAs' shows 'sweep i/total'. After the last one it starts again with new random strengths.\n\n3. Keep the KSampler seed FIXED so images differ only by the LoRAs. Change it to check a favourite combo holds up on other seeds.\n\n4. Strength: lines without one get a random model strength in strength_min..strength_max (set them equal for a fixed strength). Per line: 0.6, 0.6/1.0 (model/clip) or 0.3-0.8 (range).\n\n5. Prefix a line with ! to pin it to every image, e.g. a character LoRA vs random style partners.\n\n6. Files save as lora_roulette/<lora>-<str>__<lora>-<str>_00001_.png. Queue the same roulette seed + list to reproduce a pick.\n\nPrompt wildcards (expanded by the node with prompt_seed; prompt_seed 'fixed' = same prompt while LoRAs change):\n  {a|b}  {a|{b|c}}  {3::a|1::b} weights\n  {2$$a|b|c}  {2-3$$a|b|c}  {2$$ and $$a|b|c}\nNeeds the comfyui-lora-roulette custom node folder (no pip deps).\nExample LoRAs are public on Civitai - see the node's README."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "LoRA Roulette - how to use\n\n1. LoRA list: path ; trigger ; strength (optional). Old \"path;trigger\" lines work as-is. '#' disables a line.\n\n2. mode = random: every queue picks min_loras..max_loras LoRAs at random (roulette seed on 'randomize').\n   mode = sweep: set the roulette seed to 'increment' and queue - walks every unique combination once (no A+A, no B+A after A+B). 'Picked LoRAs' shows 'sweep i/total'. After the last one it starts again with new random strengths.\n\n3. Keep the KSampler seed FIXED so images differ only by the LoRAs. Change it to check a favourite combo holds up on other seeds.\n\n4. Strength: lines without one get a random model strength in strength_min..strength_max (set them equal for a fixed strength). Per line: 0.6, 0.6/1.0 (model/clip) or 0.3-0.8 (range).\n\n5. Prefix a line with ! to pin it to every image, e.g. a character LoRA vs random style partners.\n\n6. Files save as lora_roulette/<lora>-<str>__<lora>-<str>_00001_.png. Queue the same roulette seed + list to reproduce a pick.\n\nPrompt wildcards (expanded by the node with prompt_seed; prompt_seed 'fixed' = same prompt while LoRAs change):\n  {a|b}  {a|{b|c}}  {3::a|1::b} weights\n  {2$$a|b|c}  {2-3$$a|b|c}  {2$$ and $$a|b|c}\nNeeds the comfyui-lora-roulette custom node folder (no pip deps).\nExample LoRAs are public on Civitai - see the node's README."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
